    <briefdescription>
<para>Wrapper to model the analysis result concept. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, this will implement the invalidate method with a trivial implementation so that the actual analysis result doesn&apos;t need to provide an invalidation handler. It is only selected when the invalidation handler is not part of the ResultT&apos;s interface. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
